**Dodatkowa metoda `isSurroundedByGraphiteBlocks`:**
```java
private boolean isSurroundedByGraphiteBlocks(BlockPos blockPos, Level level) {
    int graphiteCount = 0;
    for (Direction direction : Direction.values()) {
        BlockPos neighbor = blockPos.offset(direction);
        if (level.getBlockState(neighbor).is(ModBlocks.PURIFIED_GRAPHITE_BLOCK.get())) {
            graphiteCount++;
        }
    }
    return graphiteCount >= 4;
}
```

